+"suggested_test":"Given the plans fixture trail When the Plan nav entry is clicked Then the page is #/plans/<id> and the 'Plans' navigation landmark lists build, ui and inv-001, one aria-current=page; and When the inv-001 tab is clicked Then the URL is #/plans/inv-001, the heading names inv-001, and the inv-001 tab is aria-current=page (e2e/N4/dag-1.spec.ts; the unit twin in unit/screens/dag-1-plan-nav-entry.test.tsx)","untestable_reason":null},
+{"id":"I3","rule_id":"DAG-1","layer":"tests","files":["src/Uinsure.Policies.Web/app/shell/Frame.tsx","tests/Uinsure.Policies.Web.Tests/e2e/U10/dag-1.spec.ts","tests/Uinsure.Policies.Web.Tests/unit/screens/dag-1-plan-switcher.test.tsx","tests/Uinsure.Policies.Web.Tests/e2e/U2/dag-1.spec.ts"],
